# Test a packaged game
@scenario office_lesson_16
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk listen]
pip: A project that opens in your editor can still be missing an asset on another machine.
pip: Use the game build tools for a test export. Launch it from outside the project and play the welcome chime.
@label check
pip: Which check exercises the files your audience receives?
> Play only from the editor. -> retry
> Run the exported package. -> correct
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: A packaged run resolves assets through the shipped project. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: A packaged run resolves assets through the shipped project.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_16]
[flag tutorial_done_16]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_4]
